WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.601
A useful monitoring pattern is to compare the live
result with the stored snapshot This

00:00:06.614 --> 00:00:12.432
query shows diagnosis counts from both sources After
a successful

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:18.093
refresh the values should agree for the same logic
If they differ

00:00:18.106 --> 00:00:23.514
unexpectedly investigate whether the snapshot is
stale or the definitions are inconsistent
